{"_meta":{"source":"Yahoo Finance via yfinance (profile, statements, analyst estimates)","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T15:55:53+00:00","status":"ok","error":null,"last_success":"2026-10-22T15:55:53+00:00"},"data":{"profile":{"name":"Mayr-Melnhof Karton AG","sector":"Consumer Cyclical","industry":"Packaging & Containers","country":"Austria","city":"Vienna","website":"https://www.mm.group","employees":13080,"summary":"Mayr-Melnhof Karton AG, together with its subsidiaries, manufactures and sells carton boards, paper, and folding cartons primarily in Europe. It operates through three segments: MM Food & Premium Packaging, MM Pharma & Healthcare Packaging, and MM Board & Paper. The MM Food & Premium segment processes carton boards into folding cartons primarily for the food industry and other consumer goods industries. The MM Pharma & Healthcare Packaging segment processes carton boards into folding cartons for the pharmaceutical industry, as well as leaflets and labels. The MM Board & Paper segment manufactures and markets carton boards focusing on coated carton board produced from recycled fibres, as well as virgin fibre-based carton boards. It also offers kraft papers, uncoated fine papers, and pulp. The company was founded in 1888 and is based in Vienna, Austria.","exchange":"Vienna","currency":"EUR","financial_currency":"EUR","summary_fr":"Mayr-Melnhof Karton AG, avec ses filiales, fabrique et vend des cartons, du papier et des cartons pliants principalement en Europe. Elle opère à travers trois segments : MM Food & Premium Packaging, MM Pharma & Healthcare Packaging et MM Board & Paper. Le segment MM Food & Premium transforme les cartons en cartons pliants principalement pour l'industrie alimentaire et d'autres industries de biens de consommation."},"valuation":{"market_cap_yahoo":1259127552,"shares_outstanding":19430981,"trailing_pe":null,"forward_pe":8.786441,"price_to_book":0.6030207,"ev_to_ebitda":7.232,"ev_to_revenue":0.598,"dividend_yield":0.0306,"payout_ratio":0